# ── Runtime version matrix (single source of truth for the CoreCLR payload) ────
#
# Rule: the dotnet/runtime branch is a property of the BACKEND, not of the platform.
#   Mono    -> dotnet 10  (release/10.0): .NET 11 removed Mono from the coreclr tree
#   CoreCLR -> dotnet 11  (release/11.0): .NET 10's iOS CoreCLR ships no interpreter
# Managed assemblies stay on net10.0 for both backends: the 11 runtime hosts net10 IL
# (verified on device, see Docs/rebuild/DOTNET-SDK-UNIFICATION-PLAN.md §4.0).
# Mono's branch/TFM pins live in MonoSDK (BuildMonoSDK.sh: net10.0-<os>-<type>-<arch>).
# CoreCLR is dotnet 11 on every platform. Android used to carry a tracked 10.0.12
# exception (the payload the four-combo matrix was validated on); it was removed on
# 2026-10-30 after the 11.0.0 payload passed the same B/D device runs.
# The 10 payload is kept locally as Android/arm64.v006-net10.bak for rollback.
# CopySDKFromSrc.sh resolves <KEY>_<PLATFORM> before <KEY>; CoreClrSDK.Build.cs reads
# the same keys and refuses a payload whose VERSION.txt declares a different major.
DOTNET_MAJOR=11
DOTNET_TFM=net11.0
RUNTIME_VERSION=11.0.0

# The dotnet/runtime ref every build pins to (CI clones it directly; CopySDKFromSrc.sh
# warns when a local worktree sits elsewhere). Update this one line to move all
# platforms to a new source. v11.0.0 GA is not tagged yet, so 11 pins the newest RC —
# switch to the GA tag when it lands.
SOURCE_TAG=v11.0.0-rc.3.26522.148

# Subsets the SDK actually consumes. CopySDKFromSrc.sh reads exactly these outputs:
#   clr.runtime       libcoreclr / libclrjit / libclrinterpreter
#   clr.corelib       pure-IL System.Private.CoreLib.dll (interpreter requirement)
#   clr.nativecorelib R2R CoreLib input for the runtime pack
#   libs.sfx          BCL managed assemblies + runtime-pack layout
#   libs.native       System.Native / Compression / Globalization / Security shims
#
# Deliberately absent (all unused by the SDK, pure build time):
#   clr.alljits       alt-JITs, only needed by JIT tests and ILCompiler
#   clr.tools         ILCompiler / crossgen2 publish / ILVerify / ilasm / dotnet-pgo
#   clr.packages      NuGet packaging of IL SDK / TestHost / ILAsm
#   libs.oob          out-of-band libraries not in the shared framework
#   libs.pretest      test infrastructure
BUILD_SUBSET=clr.runtime+clr.corelib+clr.nativecorelib+libs.native+libs.sfx
